WEBVTT

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:05.800
Transport attendance

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:10.134
Open Transport and Attendance. The date is today.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:22.198
Choose the route. Its students are listed, all starting as Boarded.

00:00:24.603 --> 00:00:30.107
Press Not Boarded for a student who missed the bus, and Absent for one who stayed home.

00:00:31.771 --> 00:00:37.364
Press Save All. One record is saved for every student on the route for this day.

00:00:40.345 --> 00:00:45.015
Attendance saved
